    - target: {fileID: 4711005256018735203, guid: 0daf8292e6fd6cf46a68c89d3a946ace, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Flying Frogs is a 4 player Local Multiplayer game, made in a 3-day
        gamejam with a team of 5 and expanded upon in private.\n\nGamePlay: \n3 players
        are frogs, one is a fly. The players try to catch the fly. when a player
        catches the fly, that player becomes the fly. The person with the most points
        as the fly wins!\n\nWhat I Did:\nBasic Ai\nFly controlls\nSome Backend things\nParticle
        Systems\n\nMade with:\nC#, GD Script in Godot\n(also released to steam!)\n\nGot
        3rd place at the gamejam\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
